# raft_db API Manager - Bruno Collection
# Import this into Bruno (https://www.usebruno.com/) to test the API manager

@BASE_URL = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check - Default Port (uses port 3000)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/health
### Health Check - Specified Port
GET {{BASE_URL}}/health/3001

### Values Redirect - Default Port
GET {{BASE_URL}}/values

### Values Redirect - Specified Port
GET {{BASE_URL}}/values/3002

### Command Redirect - Default Port
POST {{BASE_URL}}/command

### Command Redirect - Specified Port
POST {{BASE_URL}}/command/3003

# Test all backend ports (3000-3004) - Health

### Port 3000 Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Port 3001 Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health/3001

### Port 3002 Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health/3002

### Port 3003 Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health/3003

### Port 3004 Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health/3004

