### Port 3002 Command
POST http://localhost:8080/command/3002

### Port 3003 Command
POST http://localhost:8080/command/3003

### Port 3004 Command
POST http://localhost:8080/command/3004

# Test database commands directly on backend port 3000

### Direct DB - CreateTable
POST http://localhost:3000/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Command": "CreateTable",
  "table_id": 1,
  "table_name": "users"
}

### Direct DB - Insert
POST http://localhost:3000/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Command": "Insert",
  "table_id": 1,
  "schema": {
    "id": 1,
    "col1": "John",
    "col2": "Doe",
    "col3": "john@example.com"
  }
}

### Direct DB - Delete
POST http://localhost:3000/command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Command": "Delete",
  "table_id": 1,
  "id": 1
}

### Direct DB - Values
GET http://localhost:3000/values

