# Manager server info

### Manager Health Default
GET {{BASE_URL}}/health

### Manager Values Default
GET {{BASE_URL}}/values

### Manager Command Default
POST {{BASE_URL}}/command

### Manager with Custom Default Port
# Set MANAGER_DEFAULT_PORT=3001 before running
# GET {{BASE_URL}}/health -> redirects to http://127.0.0.1:3001/health